  "summary": "Bind the experimental Pareto compiler-to-ledger vertical.",
  "why": "The completed binder, accepted machine and change-set architecture, and frozen RET-010 inputs and oracle now support one narrow automated proof. This revision schedules that proof, preserves broad hardening as roadmap work, and corrects scope ownership to follow actual ledger state without weakening concurrent or reserved-scope guards."
